@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Ott Based System Mini Reel)

[*] --> Created

state Created
Created : entry / User has created an account
Created : do / Watch a video, upload a video or enter discussion option
Created : exit / Move to Watching, Uploading or InDiscussion


Created --> Watching : [Watch a Video]
Watching : entry / Get the Video Details
Watching : do / Validate the Video Details
Watching : exit / Valid or Invalid Video


Watching --> Created : [Invalid Video]


Watching --> Uploading : [Upload Another Video]
Uploading : entry / Upload the Video
Uploading : do / Validate the Video
Uploading : exit / Move to Watching


Uploading --> Watching : [Video Uploaded]


Watching --> ViewingLikes : [Save Video to Likes List]
ViewingLikes : entry / Get the Saved Videos
ViewingLikes : do / Display the Saved Videos
ViewingLikes : exit / Exit from Viewing Saved Videos


ViewingLikes --> Created : [Exit from Viewing Saved Videos]


Watching --> InDiscussion : [Enter Discussion Option]
InDiscussion : entry / Enter the Discussion Option
InDiscussion : do / Participate in Discussion
InDiscussion : exit / Move to Created

InDiscussion --> Created : [Exit from Discussion]

Created --> [*] : [Logout or Exit]

@enduml
